[40.491225, "o", "\u001b[32m╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mStatus, topics, shared papers, named labs, obstructions, related problems and runnable\u001b[0m \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mexperiments, all answered as graph traversals over one pinned catalog commit.\u001b[0m          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mEvery row leads back to the page it was read from.\u001b[0m                                     \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[40.491811, "o", "  \u001b[2mRoles, obstructions and labs are our classifications of the catalog's words;\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  RELATED_TO is computed. Authors are kept as written, not resolved to people.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
